    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Anyone else experiencing randomly breaking behaviour in mini.jump where you might `df(`, once or twice, then on the third time, it \"undos\" previous behaviour and also breaks other UI/highlighting behaviour?\r\n\r\nHere's a loom to illustrate, wasn't sure how to describe it:\r\nhttps://www.loom.com/share/33244493ef914e9e9109d19964fb1e1f\r\n\r\nThanks!",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Anyone else experiencing randomly breaking behaviour in mini.jump where you might <code class=\"notranslate\">df(</code>, once or twice, then on the third time, it \"undos\" previous behaviour and also breaks other UI/highlighting behaviour?</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Here's a loom to illustrate, wasn't sure how to describe it:<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/33244493ef914e9e9109d19964fb1e1f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.loom.com/share/33244493ef914e9e9109d19964fb1e1f</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Thanks!</p>",
    "bodyText": "Anyone else experiencing randomly breaking behaviour in mini.jump where you might df(, once or twice, then on the third time, it \"undos\" previous behaviour and also breaks other UI/highlighting behaviour?\nHere's a loom to illustrate, wasn't sure how to describe it:\nhttps://www.loom.com/share/33244493ef914e9e9109d19964fb1e1f\nThanks!",
