                    "body": "Also, I had begun filling out an issue for this yesterday, (the reason I recorded the Loom), but to be honest, it is something that just seemingly randomly started happening  and i had checked through my changes. :/ \r\n\r\n_answers:_\r\n \r\n- `nvim --version`: NVIM v0.8.0-dev-745-g7f4c50f8c\r\n- [dots](https://github.com/megalithic/dotfiles)\r\n\r\nAnyway, GREAT news, i  found the offending plugin: `fidget.nvim`; which is a shame, i very much appreciate the lsp feedback :/",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Also, I had begun filling out an issue for this yesterday, (the reason I recorded the Loom), but to be honest, it is something that just seemingly randomly started happening  and i had checked through my changes. :/</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>answers:</em></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">nvim --version</code>: NVIM v0.8.0-dev-745-g7f4c50f8c</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/megalithic/dotfiles\">dots</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Anyway, GREAT news, i  found the offending plugin: <code class=\"notranslate\">fidget.nvim</code>; which is a shame, i very much appreciate the lsp feedback :/</p>",
